sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Diagramme d'Interaction des Classes Internes : Code Execution Service

    participant Ctrl as SubmissionController
    participant Svc as CodeExecutionService
    participant CourseClient as CourseRestClient
    participant Sandbox as DockerSandboxExecutor
    participant Repo as SubmissionRepository
    participant SubEnt as CodeSubmission (Entity)
    participant EventPub as RabbitMQEventPublisher
    participant ExConsumer as ExerciseCreatedConsumer

    Note over Ctrl,EventPub: Scénario 1 : Soumission & Évaluation Sandbox (Synchrone + Asynchrone)
    Ctrl->>Svc: submitCode(SubmitCodeDto)
    Svc->>CourseClient: getTestCases(courseId, exerciseId) [REST Synchrone]
    CourseClient-->>Svc: List~TestCaseDto~
    Svc->>Repo: save(submissionInitial)
    Svc->>Sandbox: executeIsolated(sourceCode, language, testCases)
    Sandbox-->>Svc: SandboxExecutionReport(allPassed=true, timeMs=42)
    Svc->>SubEnt: completeEvaluation(SUCCESS, 42ms)
    Svc->>Repo: update(submission)
    Svc->>EventPub: publishCodeSolutionPassedEvent(userId, exerciseId, 42ms) [RabbitMQ]
    Svc-->>Ctrl: SubmissionStatusDto(SUCCESS)

    Note over ExConsumer,Sandbox: Scénario 2 : Pré-chauffe Runtimes (Consommation Asynchrone)
    ExConsumer->>Svc: handleExerciseCreated(ExerciseCreatedEvent)
    Svc->>Sandbox: warmUpRuntimes(language)
